أصحاب الغار","te":"The three men in the cave"},{"id":"b-hirra","s":"stories","ar":"b-hirra-ar.mp4","en":"b-hirra-en.mp4","da":29,"de":29,"ta":"المرأة والهرة","te":"The woman and the cat"},{"id":"b-baghi","s":"stories","ar":"b-baghi-ar.mp4","en":"b-baghi-en.mp4","da":25,"de":25,"ta":"الكلب والبئر","te":"The dog at the well"},{"id":"b-qatil","s":"stories","ar":"b-qatil-ar.mp4","en":"b-qatil-en.mp4","da":57,"de":77,"ta":"الذي قتل تسعة وتسعين","te":"The man who killed ninety-nine"},{"id":"b-tawba","s":"dhikr","ar":"b-tawba-ar.mp4","en":"b-tawba-en.mp4","da":21,"de":21,"ta":"فرحة الله بتوبة عبده","te":"Allah's joy at repentance"},{"id":"b-dhann","s":"dhikr","ar":"b-dhann-ar.mp4","en":"b-dhann-en.mp4","da":39,"de":48,"ta":"أنا عند ظن عبدي بي","te":"As My servant thinks of Me"},{"id":"b-hay","s":"dhikr","ar":"b-hay-ar.mp4","en":"b-hay-en.mp4","da":18,"de":25,"ta":"مثل الحي والميت","te":"The living and the dead"},{"id":"b-samh","s":"akhlaq","ar":"b-samh-ar.mp4","en":"b-samh-en.mp4","da":20,"de":20,"ta":"رحم الله رجلا سمحا","te":"The lenient man"},{"id":"b-siyam","s":"dhikr","ar":"b-siyam-ar.mp4","en":"b-siyam-en.mp4","da":50,"de":61,"ta":"الصيام لي وأنا أجزي به","te":"Fasting is for Me"},{"id":"b-jannah","s":"akhira","ar":"b-jannah-ar.mp4","en":"b-jannah-en.mp4","da":29,"de":32,"ta":"ما لا عين رأت","te":"What no eye has seen"},{"id":"b-sabaa","s":"akhira","ar":"b-sabaa-ar.mp4","en":"b-sabaa-en.mp4","da":44,"de":68,"ta":"سبعة يظلهم الله في ظله","te":"Seven in Allah's shade"},{"id":"h1","s":"nawawi","n":1,"ar":"h1-ar.mp4","en":"h1-en.mp4","da":56,"de":45,"ta":"إنَّمَا الْأَعْمَالُ بِالنِّيَّاتِ،","te":"Actions are (judged) by motives (niyyah),"},{"id":"h2","s":"nawawi","n":2,"ar":"h2-ar.mp4","en":"h2-en.mp4","da":140,"de":162,"ta":"بَيْنَمَا نَحْنُ جُلُوسٌ عِنْدَ رَسُولِ اللَّهِ صلى الله عليه و سلم ذَاتَ يَوْمٍ،","te":"While we were one day sitting with the Messenger"},{"id":"h3","s":"nawawi","n":3,"ar":"h3-ar.mp4","en":"h3-en.mp4","da":37,"de":41,"ta":"بُنِيَ الْإِسْلَامُ عَلَى خَمْسٍ:","te":"Islam has been built on five [pillars]:"},{"id":"h4","s":"nawawi","n":4,"ar":"h4-ar.mp4","en":"h4-en.mp4","da":73,"de":94,"ta":"إنَّ أَحَدَكُمْ يُجْمَعُ خَلْقُهُ فِي بَطْنِ أُمِّهِ أَرْبَعِينَ يَوْمًا نُطْفَةً،","te":"Verily the creation of each one of you"},{"id":"h5","s":"nawawi","n":5,"ar":"h5-ar.mp4","en":"h5-en.mp4","da":29,"de":34,"ta":"رَسُولُ اللَّهِ صلى الله عليه و سلم مَنْ أَحْدَثَ فِي أَمْرِنَا","te":"He who innovates something in this matter of ours (i.e.,"},{"id":"h6","s":"nawawi","n":6,"ar":"h6-ar.mp4","en":"h6-en.mp4","da":56,"de":64,"ta":"إنَّ الْحَلَالَ بَيِّنٌ،","te":"That which is lawful is clear"},{"id":"h7","s":"nawawi","n":7,"ar":"h7-ar.mp4","en":"h7-en.mp4","da":30,"de":31,"ta":"الدِّينُ النَّصِيحَةُ.\" قُلْنَا: لِمَنْ؟ قَالَ: \"لِلَّهِ، وَلِكِتَابِهِ، وَلِرَسُولِهِ،","te":"The deen (religion) is naseehah (advice,"},{"id":"h8","s":"nawawi","n":8,"ar":"h8-ar.mp4","en":"h8-en.mp4","da":37,"de":41,"ta":"أُمِرْتُ أَنْ أُقَاتِلَ النَّاسَ حَتَّى يَشْهَدُوا أَنْ","te":"I have been ordered to fight against the people"},{"id":"h9","s":"nawawi","n":9,"ar":"h9-ar.mp4","en":"h9-en.mp4","da":34,"de":32,"ta":"مَا نَهَيْتُكُمْ عَنْهُ فَاجْتَنِبُوهُ،","te":"What I have forbidden for you, avoid."},{"id":"h10","s":"nawawi","n":10,"ar":"h10-ar.mp4","en":"h10-en.mp4","da":54,"de":72,"ta":"قَالَ رَسُولُ اللَّهِ صلى الله عليه و سلم \"إنَّ اللَّهَ طَيِّبٌ لَا يَقْبَلُ إلَّا طَيِّبًا،","te":"Allah the Almighty is Good and accepts only that which is good."},{"id":"h11","s":"nawawi","n":11,"ar":"h11-ar.mp4","en":"h11-en.mp4","da":31,"de":39,"ta":"عَنْ أَبِي مُحَمَّدٍ الْحَسَنِ بْنِ عَلِيِّ بْنِ","te":"Leave that which makes you doubt for"},{"id":"h12","s":"nawawi","n":12,"ar":"h12-ar.mp4","en":"h12-en.mp4","da":22,"de":29,"ta":"عَنْ أَبِي هُرَيْرَةَ رَضِيَ اللهُ عَنْهُ قَالَ:","te":"Part of the perfection of one’s Islam is his leaving"},{"id":"h13","s":"nawawi","n":13,"ar":"h13-ar.mp4","en":"h13-en.mp4","da":29,"de":29,"ta":"لَا يُؤْمِنُ أَحَدُكُمْ حَتَّى يُحِبَّ لِأَخِيهِ مَا يُحِبُّ لِنَفْسِهِ .","te":"None of you [truly]"},{"id":"h14","s":"nawawi","n":14,"ar":"h14-ar.mp4","en":"h14-en.mp4","da":32,"de":33,"ta":"قَالَ رَسُولُ اللَّهِ صلى الله عليه و سلم لَا يَحِلُّ دَمُ امْرِئٍ","te":"It is not permissible to spill the"},{"id":"h15","s":"nawawi","n":15,"ar":"h15-ar.mp4","en":"h15-en.mp4","da":32,"de":33,"ta":"مَنْ كَانَ يُؤْمِنُ بِاَللَّهِ وَالْيَوْمِ الْآخِرِ فَلْيَقُلْ خَيْرًا أَوْ لِيَصْمُتْ،","te":"Let him who believes in Allah and the Last Day speak good,"},{"id":"h16","s":"nawawi","n":16,"ar":"h16-ar.mp4","en":"h16-en.mp4","da":24,"de":34,"ta":"عَنْ أَبِي هُرَيْرَةَ رَضِيَ اللهُ عَنْهُ أَنَّ رَجُلًا قَالَ لِلنَّبِيِّ صلى الله عليه و سلم أَوْصِنِي. قَالَ:","te":"Counsel me,” so he (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said,"},{"id":"h17","s":"nawawi","n":17,"ar":"h17-ar.mp4","en":"h17-en.mp4","da":30,"de":37,"ta":"إنَّ اللَّهَ كَتَبَ الْإِحْسَانَ عَلَى كُلِّ شَيْءٍ،","te":"Verily Allah has prescribed ihsan (proficiency,"},{"id":"h18","s":"nawawi","n":18,"ar":"h18-ar.mp4","en":"h18-en.mp4","da":35,"de":42,"ta":"اتَّقِ اللَّهَ حَيْثُمَا كُنْت،","te":"Have taqwa (fear) of Allah wherever you may be,"},{"id":"h19","s":"nawawi","n":19,"ar":"h19-ar.mp4","en":"h19-en.mp4","da":79,"de":98,"ta":"يَا غُلَامِ!","te":"O young man,"},{"id":"h20","s":"nawawi","n":20,"ar":"h20-ar.mp4","en":"h20-en.mp4","da":25,"de":29,"ta":"قَالَ رَسُولُ اللَّهِ صلى الله عليه و سلم إنَّ مِمَّا أَدْرَكَ النَّاسُ مِنْ كَلَامِ النُّبُوَّةِ الْأُولَى:","te":"from what was learnt by the people"},{"id":"h21","s":"nawawi","n":21,"ar":"h21-ar.mp4","en":"h21-en.mp4","da":28,"de":32,"ta":"قُلْ لِي فِي الْإِسْلَامِ قَوْلًا لَا أَسْأَلُ عَنْهُ أَحَدًا غَيْرَك؛ قَالَ: قُلْ:","te":"tell me something about al-Islam which I can ask of no one"},{"id":"h22","s":"nawawi","n":22,"ar":"h22-ar.mp4","en":"h22-en.mp4","da":35,"de":43,"ta":"أَنَّ رَجُلًا سَأَلَ رَسُولَ اللَّهِ صلى الله عليه و سلم فَقَالَ:","te":"A man questioned the Messenger of Allah"},{"id":"h23","s":"nawawi","n":23,"ar":"h23-ar.mp4","en":"h23-en.mp4","da":45,"de":57,"ta":"قَالَ رَسُولُ اللَّهِ صلى الله عليه و سلم الطَّهُورُ شَطْرُ الْإِيمَانِ،","te":"Purity is half of iman (faith)."},{"id":"h24","s":"nawawi","n":24,"ar":"h24-ar.mp4","en":"h24-en.mp4","da":127,"de":140,"ta":"إنِّي حَرَّمْت الظُّلْمَ عَلَى نَفْسِي،","te":"I have forbidden dhulm (oppression) for Myself,"},{"id":"h25","s":"nawawi","n":25,"ar":"h25-ar.mp4","en":"h25-en.mp4","da":72,"de":95,"ta":"لِلنَّبِيِّ صلى الله عليه و سلم يَا رَسُولَ اللَّهِ ذَهَبَ أَهْلُ الدُّثُورِ بِالْأُجُورِ؛","te":"the affluent have made off with the rewards;"},{"id":"h26","s":"nawawi","n":26,"ar":"h26-ar.mp4","en":"h26-en.mp4","da":41,"de":46,"ta":"قَالَ رَسُولُ اللَّهِ صلى الله عليه و سلم كُلُّ سُلَامَى مِنْ النَّاسِ عَلَيْهِ صَدَقَةٌ،","te":"Every joint of a person must perform"},{"id":"h27","s":"nawawi","n":27,"ar":"h27-ar.mp4","en":"h27-en.mp4","da":64,"de":79,"ta":"الْبِرُّ حُسْنُ الْخُلُقِ،","te":"Righteousness is in good character,"},{"id":"h28","s":"nawawi","n":28,"ar":"h28-ar.mp4","en":"h28-en.mp4","da":57,"de":78,"ta":"وَعَظَنَا رَسُولُ اللَّهِ صلى الله عليه و سلم مَوْعِظَةً وَجِلَتْ مِنْهَا الْقُلُوبُ،","te":"gave us a sermon by which our hearts were"},{"id":"h29","s":"nawawi","n":29,"ar":"h29-ar.mp4","en":"h29-en.mp4","da":116,"de":147,"ta":"أَخْبِرْنِي بِعَمَلٍ يُدْخِلُنِي الْجَنَّةَ وَيُبَاعِدْنِي مِنْ النَّارِ، قَالَ:","te":"On the authority of Muadh bin Jabal"},{"id":"h30","s":"nawawi","n":30,"ar":"h30-ar.mp4","en":"h30-en.mp4","da":39,"de":45,"ta":"إنَّ اللَّهَ تَعَالَى فَرَضَ فَرَائِضَ فَلَا تُضَيِّعُوهَا،","te":"Verily Allah ta’ala has laid down religious obligations (fara’id),"},{"id":"h31","s":"nawawi","n":31,"ar":"h31-ar.mp4","en":"h31-en.mp4","da":39,"de":45,"ta":"دُلَّنِي عَلَى عَمَلٍ إذَا عَمِلْتُهُ أَحَبَّنِي اللهُ وَأَحَبَّنِي النَّاسُ؛ فَقَالَ:","te":"direct me to an act which,"},{"id":"h32","s":"nawawi","n":32,"ar":"h32-ar.mp4","en":"h32-en.mp4","da":42,"de":47,"ta":"لَا ضَرَرَ وَلَا ضِرَارَ\" .","te":"There should be neither harming (darar) nor reciprocating harm (dirar)."},{"id":"h33","s":"nawawi","n":33,"ar":"h33-ar.mp4","en":"h33-en.mp4","da":35,"de":38,"ta":"لَوْ يُعْطَى النَّاسُ بِدَعْوَاهُمْ لَادَّعَى رِجَالٌ أَمْوَالَ قَوْمٍ وَدِمَاءَهُمْ،","te":"Were people to be given everything that they claimed,"},{"id":"h34","s":"nawawi","n":34,"ar":"h34-ar.mp4","en":"h34-en.mp4","da":28,"de":33,"ta":"مَنْ رَأَى مِنْكُمْ مُنْكَرًا فَلْيُغَيِّرْهُ بِيَدِهِ،","te":"Whosoever of you sees an evil,"},{"id":"h35","s":"nawawi","n":35,"ar":"h35-ar.mp4","en":"h35-en.mp4","da":49,"de":62,"ta":"قَالَ رَسُولُ اللَّهِ صلى الله عليه و سلم لَا تَحَاسَدُوا،","te":"Do not envy one another,"},{"id":"h36","s":"nawawi","n":36,"ar":"h36-ar.mp4","en":"h36-en.mp4","da":65,"de":83,"ta":"مَنْ نَفَّسَ عَنْ مُؤْمِنٍ كُرْبَةً مِنْ كُرَبِ الدُّنْيَا","te":"Whoever removes a worldly grief from a believer,"},{"id":"h37","s":"nawawi","n":37,"ar":"h37-ar.mp4","en":"h37-en.mp4","da":54,"de":67,"ta":"إنَّ اللَّهَ كَتَبَ الْحَسَنَاتِ وَالسَّيِّئَاتِ،","te":"On the authority of Ibn Abbas (may Allah be pleased with him),"},{"id":"h38","s":"nawawi","n":38,"ar":"h38-ar.mp4","en":"h38-en.mp4","da":48,"de":64,"ta":"مَنْ عَادَى لِي وَلِيًّا فَقْد آذَنْتهُ بِالْحَرْبِ،","te":"‘Whosoever shows enmity to a wali (friend) of Mine,"},{"id":"h39","s":"nawawi","n":39,"ar":"h39-ar.mp4","en":"h39-en.mp4","da":25,"de":32,"ta":"إنَّ اللَّهَ تَجَاوَزَ لِي عَنْ أُمَّتِي الْخَطَأَ وَالنِّسْيَانَ وَمَا اسْتُكْرِهُوا عَلَيْهِ\" .","te":"Verily Allah has pardoned [or been lenient with]"},{"id":"h40","s":"nawawi","n":40,"ar":"h40-ar.mp4","en":"h40-en.mp4","da":38,"de":43,"ta":"كُنْ فِي الدُّنْيَا كَأَنَّك غَرِيبٌ أَوْ عَابِرُ سَبِيلٍ .","te":"a stranger or a wayfarer.” And Ibn Umar"},{"id":"h41","s":"nawawi","n":41,"ar":"h41-ar.mp4","en":"h41-en.mp4","da":28,"de":32,"ta":"قَالَ رَسُولُ اللَّهِ صلى الله عليه و سلم \"لَا يُؤْمِنُ أَحَدُكُمْ","te":"None of you [truly]"},{"id":"h42","s":"nawawi","n":42,"ar":"h42-ar.mp4","en":"h42-en.mp4","da":49,"de":55,"ta":"يَا ابْنَ آدَمَ!","te":"‘O Son of Adam,"},{"id":"l-wudu","s":"learn","mz":"sunni","ar":"l-wudu-ar.mp4","en":"l-wudu-en.mp4","da":156,"de":151,"ta":"الوضوء","te":"Wudu (ablution)","st":{"ar":[2.6,13.79,16.47,20.39,39.71,69.93,89.12,131.29,140.78],"en":[2.6,16.3,18.46,21.89,35.8,58.72,81.21,118.28,125.27]}},{"id":"l-ghusl","s":"learn","mz":"sunni","ar":"l-ghusl-ar.mp4","en":"l-ghusl-en.mp4","da":39,"de":40,"ta":"غسل الجنابة","te":"Ghusl (full bath)","st":{"ar":[2.6,13.3,19.87,23.77,30.57],"en":[2.6,14.34,22.87,25.23,32.4]}},{"id":"l-salah","s":"learn","mz":"sunni","ar":"l-salah-ar.mp4","en":"l-salah-en.mp4","da":190,"de":156,"ta":"الصلاة","te":"The prayer","st":{"ar":[2.6,10.22,14.76,19.97,22.29,26.1,30.0,33.92,37.45,44.26,72.91,83.8,92.52,102.88,115.15,149.19],"en":[2.6,12.62,15.39,20.02,21.95,24.33,26.38,28.97,31.44,34.56,51.84,56.94,63.32,68.28,72.09,106.04]}},{"id":"l-arkan","s":"learn","mz":"sunni","ar":"l-arkan-ar.mp4","en":"l-arkan-en.mp4","da":33,"de":50,"ta":"أركان الإسلام","te":"The pillars of Islam","st":{"ar":[2.6,13.06,18.99,21.76,24.59,26.62],"en":[2.6,13.72,23.25,30.27,35.8,41.73]}},{"id":"l-wd","s":"learn","mz":"all","ar":"l-wd-ar.mp4","en":"l-wd-en.mp4","da":55,"de":40,"ta":"أذكار الوضوء","te":"Wudu remembrance","st":{"ar":[2.6,11.96,29.83,38.49],"en":[2.6,4.6,15.81,25.0]}},{"id":"l-ms","s":"learn","mz":"all","ar":"l-ms-ar.mp4","en":"l-ms-en.mp4","da":235,"de":191,"ta":"الأذان والمسجد","te":"Adhan & the mosque","st":{"ar":[2.6,22.45,46.0,54.18,76.92,85.9,181.72,211.38],"en":[2.6,24.79,47.87,57.03,92.73,102.66,157.16,175.13]}},{"id":"l-hm","s":"learn","mz":"all","ar":"l-hm-ar.mp4","en":"l-hm-en.mp4","da":82,"de":50,"ta":"البيت والخلاء","te":"Home & restroom","st":{"ar":[2.6,18.53,36.99,57.83,71.22],"en":[2.6,10.09,27.85,35.6,43.19]}},{"id":"l-fd","s":"learn","mz":"all","ar":"l-fd-ar.mp4","en":"l-fd-en.mp4","da":72,"de":76,"ta":"آداب الطعام","te":"Eating","st":{"ar":[2.6,18.27,39.27,56.32],"en":[2.6,15